WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.024 --> 00:00:03.220
With the partbank desktop app

2
00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:07.031
A part's detail page in the partbank desktop app

3
00:00:07.031 --> 00:00:10.176
labnoteo로 보내기 (Send to labnoteo) opens Obsidian

4
00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:13.675
Register it as a sample of this experiment

5
00:00:13.675 --> 00:00:18.315
The reference goes in at the cursor of the open note

6
00:00:18.315 --> 00:00:22.048
A few seconds after the save, the usage reaches partbank

7
00:00:22.048 --> 00:00:24.403
Waiting (fast-forward)

8
00:00:24.403 --> 00:00:27.875
전자노트 사용처 (Note usages) lists this note, for you only

9
00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:32.104
Click a section to open it in Obsidian

10
00:00:32.104 --> 00:00:39.054
In the Samples view, right-click → Open in partbank

11
00:00:39.054 --> 00:00:43.243
The desktop app shows that part
